 passing the returned value from the first into the second.\n-/\n@[always_inline, inline]\nprotected def bind (x : EStateM ε σ α) (f : α → EStateM ε σ β) : EStateM ε σ β := fun s =>\n  match x s with\n  | Result.ok a s    => f a s\n  | Result.error e s => Result.error e s","start":4457,"end":4464},"axioms":[]}